values
  ('d38ec343-7be7-5aa2-a471-402ce3f37e41', '267c5978-b6b0-5f20-92a3-e94609fbb0c9', 'https://www.infobunker.com/overview.shtml', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P4 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] I SAW: URL and summary text asserting a 65,000 sq ft facility over 50 feet underground, three-foot reinforced concrete, survival of a 20-megaton blast at 2.5 miles, a ''former Government Command Bunker purpose-built by the military'', founding in 2004 and clients from 2006 after a multi-million-dollar rebuild. SELF-PUBLISHED and, for the hardening and military-origin claims, SELF-ATTESTING under §2.5: the operator is the party advancing the claim and the claim is the product. Excluded from V; evidence for ORIGIN only.'),
