  ('3f02d300-9a51-5bc9-a018-888ebd0ff98d', 'bb6495f4-e85d-58cb-a094-56b9a10d9c99', 'https://www.npr.org/transcripts/512268749', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P3 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: URL only in a result block. INFER: a broadcast transcript involving the facility. A transcript is a custody-bearing artifact for attestation (§5.4) and is worth acquiring for exactly that reason.'),
