  ('51b26795-56b8-5f3f-8e86-246537c10a54', '1299ef81-7360-5807-9674-fd8b44e3ed53', 'https://psmag.com/news/at-home-with-the-couple-that-launched-the-doomsday-bunker-industry/', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P3 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title and URL. The headline itself is the origin claim I am recording as a hypothesis — a magazine asserting these people started the industry. That is an assertion, not a dated negative receipt.'),
