  ('e90f9775-63ee-5632-bcc7-ecd1978cbd11', '685089e3-e9e1-528a-87dc-9b354a43d485', 'https://www.missilebases.com/', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P4 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: the domain in result blocks (including a /nike/ and an /atlas-f/ path). The SOURCE-REGISTRY classes this as a P4 source holding genuinely primary data, because a broker with lawful physical access must document a property to sell it. The high-value move — a Wayback CDX sweep of missilebases.com/* to recover delisted sold-property listings with their as-built drawings and disposal narratives — is unavailable to me and should be queued.'),
