  ('537a32c3-b823-5f88-8bcc-7d832c28a38d', '1c64ffc1-c8b7-5245-8393-eca888ae88d1', 'https://cdphe.colorado.gov/hm/titan-1-missile-complexes', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P1 | FETCH-BLOCKED] ATTEMPTED AND BLOCKED: WebFetch returned EGRESS_BLOCKED for cdphe.colorado.gov. SAW ONLY a search summary reporting six complexes and their distribution, PCE/TCE above basic groundwater standards at two monitoring wells at Complex 2C, no domestic-well exceedances above drinking-water standards, CDPHE working with USACE, public and private ownership, and an in-situ treatability study underway. I have NOT read this page. Every figure above is a summarising model''s report of it and must be re-derived from bytes before any of it is graded.'),
  ('8fb4d1be-4232-5699-83fc-97467254d0d3', '245a1843-c12e-5dab-af37-e2824b51b3f1', 'https://www.toxicdocs.org/d/gDVGL9xYrJzQbMQMmJ6kBwJ4e', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P2 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title and URL. INFER: an archive mirror of what is probably the CDPHE fact sheet. If cdphe.colorado.gov stays unreachable this is the designated-faithful-mirror route — which under §2.6 and CAP-6 would cap any resulting grade at B until the issuing authority resolves.'),
  ('d1045167-0fc3-58a8-b179-0da306d483ba', '1d8a26cf-8c4e-5779-92ec-933394a8d764', 'https://denvergazette.com/news/arapahoe-county-inside-silo-rescue-mission/article_d5ab8376-0bf6-11ef-a98f-8bd703006672.html', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P3 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title and URL only — I have not read one sentence of it. The TITLE alone establishes that a county rescue operation at a missile silo was reported by a metro daily in 2024. Even the title is an incident-generated, claim-independent signal, which is why I have kept it.'),
  ('cc14ce00-b07c-5987-b655-51baef1553f3', '199f1af0-cf4b-5738-89de-d0cc29cf7303', 'https://www.coloradonuclearatlas.org/brief/titan/deployment', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P3 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title and URL. An academic/public-humanities mapping project; likely a transparent compiler exposing primaries, which would make it a conduit rather than a terminus under §5.1.3.'),
  ('d3231252-447d-501d-b07b-bfdf11389826', '3861c32b-5e85-52ec-9fdb-a2a11dd10075', 'https://openroadcolorado.com/titan-1-missile/', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P4 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title, URL, and a summary line asserting some complexes have been ''sold or adapted for alternate use like data storage or private tours''. That unattributed ''data storage'' assertion is recorded in refuted_or_hollow below — it names no operator, no site and no source.'),
  ('3ad0e65d-9eff-5170-bf63-de4171dd5848', '42e08828-c7f0-584c-9a60-64661888af31', 'https://risingsun4x4club.org/xf/threads/deer-trail-missile-silo.19536/page-2', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P5 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: thread title and a summary noting a comment that ''724-C finally sold at auction''. FORUM POST — T5, uncorroborated, ADVERSARY-WRITABLE-adjacent. Recorded ONLY because it is where the ''724-C'' designation entered my sweep, which matters for the unresolved IDENTITY proposition. It is a lead and nothing else.'),
  ('5ff03023-f951-5e5d-88aa-304caa91f8d1', 'ae7d793c-d4fe-5bd6-8e1d-af812ba30d2f', 'https://encyclopediaofarkansas.net/entries/titan-ii-missile-explosion-2543/', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P3 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title, URL, and summary content placing the complex at Southside, Van Buren County, north of Damascus, and describing the 19 Sept 1980 explosion, one fatality, and the complex''s destruction. A peer-edited state encyclopaedia; a good secondary but not a primary.'),
  ('52b84bc1-c6cd-58f3-918e-e029c2009155', 'b9947ffb-5d62-563e-bdcd-cbb4bbd853d0', 'https://www.arkansasheritage.com/docs/default-source/national-registry/vb0050-pdf.pdf', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P1 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: this URL and the document title ''Titan II ICBM Launch Complex 374-7 Site Name of Property'' in a search result block. NOT OPENED. I am recording the URL exactly as it appeared and am deliberately NOT converting the ''vb0050'' path token into an asserted survey or reference number — I do not know what it denotes. This is the single highest-value acquirable document for this candidate: NRHP nominations for Cold War properties routinely carry construction dates, contractor names, structural descriptions and floor plans.'),
  ('69b9f935-ea13-5651-9c61-60c74079ab3f', '020699ec-3a16-5097-82e2-f89b0047b819', 'https://scalar.usc.edu/works/brokenarrowproject/1980---damascus-arkansas', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P3 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title and URL. An academic digital-scholarship project; likely a transparent compiler exposing primaries.'),
  ('08d3f93f-5937-5888-ad55-5194717fe30f', '9164bb37-0dbb-5a41-9527-e4bf9298e367', 'https://overlandtrains.com/updates/visiting-damascus-titan-ii-missile-silo-part-i/', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P4 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title and URL, plus a summary describing remaining cement pads and a back-filled silo behind a tan barn with the access gate locked. A single visitor''s direct observation — for the register''s purposes this is a named-account lead requiring §5.4 resolvability work, not evidence yet.'),
  ('d301b3fc-7c50-5913-99e7-dd814509dcbd', '9331fd87-0d52-544a-900c-1bc8cdd65a92', 'https://www.kuaf.com/show/ozarks-at-large/2025-09-15/revisiting-the-1980-damascus-titan-ii-missile-disaster-45-years-later', 'UNRESOLVED', 'code', '[P3 | SEARCH-SNIPPET-ONLY] SAW: title, URL, date. Public-radio retrospective; a recency anchor showing the site remained newsworthy in 2025.')
