  ('18c47b7f-b1e6-5f2b-86a4-53adae76fa98', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — a hardened Defense Communications Agency AUTOVON switching and troposcatter relay chain and nothing more: a commercial carrier building military-grade voice plant under DoD contract, hardened because DoD''s own specifications required survivable switching, with no sheltering or relocation role for any person. This null accounts for every physical feature reported: earth cover, blast valves, decontamination bay, standby generation, filtered positive-pressure ventilation, elevated physical security, remote siting. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: berthing. A switching station houses equipment and a small maintenance crew; a relocation facility houses people. Bunk capacity, galley and messing provisions, potable-water storage sized to a population rather than to a crew, sanitary capacity, and a decontamination bay sized for personnel rather than vehicles all discriminate cleanly. Secondary discriminators: whether the parcel was ever federally leased or subject to a federal restrictive covenant (county deed chain); whether the site carries a federal frequency assignment in the NTIA GMF as well as an FCC licence; whether any DD-1391 or MILCON line names the location. All of these are checkable and none was checked in this sweep. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
