  ('bf8788a0-fcc7-573d-b89b-e370168860f5', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — an AT&T long-haul microwave and switching station, hardened in the 1960s to DoD''s AUTOVON survivability specification, which since divestiture has become an ordinary piece of AT&T network real estate and which in 2016 the company wanted to expand into a conventional carrier data centre, on a mountaintop it already owned, in the county that hosts more data-centre capacity than anywhere on earth. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: the 2016 file itself — a data-centre build has a named electrical service agreement with Dominion, a cooling design, a raised-floor or rack layout and a stated IT load, all of which appear in commission-permit engineering exhibits; a hardened federal build has none of those and instead has shielding, filtration and berthing. Second discriminator: the Loudoun parcel and deed chain — a federal leasehold, easement or restrictive covenant on an AT&T fee parcel is unusual and would be visible. Third: whether the 1960s structure carries any NTIA federal frequency assignment as distinct from AT&T''s FCC licences. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('89a35214-73c8-5176-98aa-f748bc7a7370', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — a hardened AT&T AUTOVON switching terminal and troposcatter station, built with AT&T capital on land AT&T bought, serving DoD voice traffic under contract, whose secrecy is contractual rather than constitutional and which was decommissioned when troposcatter and AUTOVON became obsolete. This accounts for the scale, the secrecy, the security, the 45-year operating life and the 2008 shutdown. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: berthing and life support sized for a population rather than a crew; a federal leasehold or covenant in the Chatham County deed chain; and — the cheapest test available — whether the Greenbrier switchboard appearance is a trunk group to a switch (mundane) or a dedicated station line to a habitable facility (not mundane). The second is answerable from the Greenbrier''s own publicly displayed equipment. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('ae1fb964-fd9e-53a1-a02e-2ca8b4fdc6fb', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — a hardened AT&T AUTOVON switching terminal and troposcatter station, built with AT&T capital on land AT&T bought, serving DoD voice traffic under contract, whose secrecy is contractual rather than constitutional and which was decommissioned when troposcatter and AUTOVON became obsolete. This accounts for the scale, the secrecy, the security, the 45-year operating life and the 2008 shutdown. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: berthing and life support sized for a population rather than a crew; a federal leasehold or covenant in the Chatham County deed chain; and — the cheapest test available — whether the Greenbrier switchboard appearance is a trunk group to a switch (mundane) or a dedicated station line to a habitable facility (not mundane). The second is answerable from the Greenbrier''s own publicly displayed equipment. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
