  ('de937051-854d-524c-97bd-44eaa88fa36c', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — a hardened AT&T AUTOVON switching terminal and troposcatter station, built with AT&T capital on land AT&T bought, serving DoD voice traffic under contract, whose secrecy is contractual rather than constitutional and which was decommissioned when troposcatter and AUTOVON became obsolete. This accounts for the scale, the secrecy, the security, the 45-year operating life and the 2008 shutdown. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: berthing and life support sized for a population rather than a crew; a federal leasehold or covenant in the Chatham County deed chain; and — the cheapest test available — whether the Greenbrier switchboard appearance is a trunk group to a switch (mundane) or a dedicated station line to a habitable facility (not mundane). The second is answerable from the Greenbrier''s own publicly displayed equipment. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('ead538ec-18aa-5ef8-8f58-d7cf5f926ad5', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — an AT&T hardened AUTOVON switching and troposcatter terminal, still in service as ordinary long-haul network plant, whose 2007 re-equipping is routine carrier lifecycle investment. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: Washington County parcel and permit records for the 2007 works, which would show the scale and character of the investment; whether any part of the site is federally leased; and berthing capacity, as with the rest of the chain. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('80666b35-26e7-55c1-a004-0c0935ef49dd', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — an AT&T hardened AUTOVON switching and troposcatter terminal, still in service as ordinary long-haul network plant, whose 2007 re-equipping is routine carrier lifecycle investment. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: Washington County parcel and permit records for the 2007 works, which would show the scale and character of the investment; whether any part of the site is federally leased; and berthing capacity, as with the rest of the chain. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('674c489d-bf94-5d39-81ce-9a4220437682', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — an AT&T hardened AUTOVON switching and troposcatter terminal, still in service as ordinary long-haul network plant, whose 2007 re-equipping is routine carrier lifecycle investment. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: Washington County parcel and permit records for the 2007 works, which would show the scale and character of the investment; whether any part of the site is federally leased; and berthing capacity, as with the rest of the chain. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('5b1d56c1-e39d-5ec2-b2a0-c3e82a343e85', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — an AT&T long-haul relay site, hardened in the 1960s for AUTOVON, which in 2007 received a very large but entirely commercial re-equipping as a core network node or carrier data hall. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: the permit file itself. A permit for a data hall names cooling tonnage, generator capacity and electrical service; a permit for a hardened federal facility names shielding, filtration or blast components, or is not filed with the county at all. The Albemarle permit viewer would answer this in one query and nobody appears to have run it. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('b56f326c-61bc-5e8e-aee4-0b93586f6ae1', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — an AT&T long-haul relay site, hardened in the 1960s for AUTOVON, which in 2007 received a very large but entirely commercial re-equipping as a core network node or carrier data hall. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: the permit file itself. A permit for a data hall names cooling tonnage, generator capacity and electrical service; a permit for a hardened federal facility names shielding, filtration or blast components, or is not filed with the county at all. The Albemarle permit viewer would answer this in one query and nobody appears to have run it. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('02d6278e-bf5b-5622-be8d-da93b70b7453', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 — an AT&T long-haul relay site, hardened in the 1960s for AUTOVON, which in 2007 received a very large but entirely commercial re-equipping as a core network node or carrier data hall. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT: the permit file itself. A permit for a data hall names cooling tonnage, generator capacity and electrical service; a permit for a hardened federal facility names shielding, filtration or blast components, or is not filed with the county at all. The Albemarle permit viewer would answer this in one query and nobody appears to have run it. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('221cb2eb-ab51-57eb-b36b-f7540f0ae1b5', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07 / A12 — a decommissioned AT&T troposcatter relay of a well-documented Cold War type, obsolete, sold off, and now a private house with a very unusual basement. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH IT from a facility with a continuing role: the deed chain and current assessment record, both public in Buckingham County, plus the simple fact that a residence and a classified facility cannot occupy the same footprint. Here the mundane alternative is probably the truth about the present, and the live question is only about 1958–2000. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
