  ('bb034a2d-d0a2-517f-b396-868664ac8440', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07, and in this case the mundane alternative is almost certainly simply the truth: unmanned commercial microwave repeaters on a telephone company''s long-haul route, of which several hundred were built, most now derelict, sold, or repurposed for cellular and public-safety radio. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH a hardened site from these: a subsurface structure at all; crew accommodation; blast doors; filtered positive-pressure ventilation; a decontamination provision; and a place on the L-carrier main-station list rather than on the repeater list. Those are bright lines and they are documented in the corpus itself. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
