values
  ('192d5989-66e9-57e3-950e-5db51b84b604', 'A07', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A07, and in this case the mundane alternative is almost certainly simply the truth: unmanned commercial microwave repeaters on a telephone company''s long-haul route, of which several hundred were built, most now derelict, sold, or repurposed for cellular and public-safety radio. WHAT WOULD DISTINGUISH a hardened site from these: a subsurface structure at all; crew accommodation; blast doors; filtered positive-pressure ventilation; a decontamination provision; and a place on the L-carrier main-station list rather than on the repeater list. Those are bright lines and they are documented in the corpus itself. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('8c4a35e3-9a52-5d32-b5dd-1ff27f831cfa', 'A11', true, 'selected-strongest', 'A11, claim fabricated - specifically, a fabrication generated inside a documented AFOSI disinformation operation against one man, then extended as deliberate creative writing by LeVesque. The co-null is A12, a decommissioned facility of a different known typology: Project Gasbuggy, the 1967 Plowshare nuclear detonation, is roughly 21 miles from Dulce and is a real, documented, government-caused subsurface anomaly in the same district. Distinguishing them: Gasbuggy is at INSTANCE scope for Gasbuggy and ADJACENT for Archuleta Mesa, so under BES 2.4 it is excluded from V here entirely - proximity is not support, and it is equally not a substitute. What would actually distinguish: BLM/Jicarilla land-status records, a spoil-volume signature for an excavation of the claimed scale, or any procurement trace. None retrieved. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
