  ('512a81dc-6230-5271-b040-8c6ddff85b2c', 'A11', true, 'selected-strongest', 'For the FEAT claim: A10/A08 - a real, large, hardened federal emergency operations centre whose actual interior is classified, described in 1976 in terms supplied by unnamed former officials and never since corroborated. What would distinguish an underground city from a large hardened EOC: any floor-area figure in a GSA or FEMA record, any NEPA document, any construction drawing. The site''s own documentary record is genuinely rich; the city is not in it. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
