  ('c3f6fafe-c9fb-5157-b358-18a99d81f637', 'A11', true, 'selected-strongest', 'There is no interesting null for EXIST — it is a photographed, toured, reviewed private residence. The null that matters is on ORIG: A11-adjacent, ''the technical descriptors attached to this site and propagated by the associated brokerage are marketing language rather than engineering fact.'' Distinguished by comparing the brokerage''s descriptive claims against Corps of Engineers Atlas E design records or against an independent technical source such as the FAS Atlas silo description. I made a first pass at exactly that and it produced the wall-thickness finding below. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
  ('72f9517c-2be0-548d-9eac-d44acf453ed1', 'A11', true, 'selected-strongest', 'There is no interesting null for EXIST — it is a photographed, toured, reviewed private residence. The null that matters is on ORIG: A11-adjacent, ''the technical descriptors attached to this site and propagated by the associated brokerage are marketing language rather than engineering fact.'' Distinguished by comparing the brokerage''s descriptive claims against Corps of Engineers Atlas E design records or against an independent technical source such as the FAS Atlas silo description. I made a first pass at exactly that and it produced the wall-thickness finding below. | null_state as graded: SURVIVING. DERIVED per 4.6, and VACUOUS. A named null is present so the state is not UNTESTED; DOMINANT requires the null to be affirmatively documented by a verified T1/T2 row and none exists; INSUFFICIENT and EXCLUDED require verified rows in V at D2+/D3+ and V is empty. SURVIVING therefore holds only because the null trivially accounts for all zero rows in V. This must not be read as a finding that the mundane explanation is strong.', 'claude-opus-5 (W1 grading pass)'),
