-- Observations. One row per supporting/undercutting entry carried by resolved.json for a
-- loaded proposition. Every row cites the W1 dossier (the artifact actually held), at magnitude 0
-- (DEFAULT = D0: no diagnosticity is claimed for unread text), scope CLASS, binding unadjudicated.
-- With no receipt, the provenance-sync trigger sets prov_receipt_state='UNRESOLVED' and the
-- GENERATED membership column lands every row in V0: retained, displayed, arithmetically inert.
